-- src:1443 | character, even if the third party proceedings are not
-- src:1444 | international and commercial in nature; and
@ref s 18D(3)(c) (src:1431-1444)
GIVEN `the Singapore International Commercial Court has and exercises jurisdiction under section 18D(1) over the action` IS A BOOLEAN
